          "paragraphs": [
            "7. 已知集合 $A=\\{x \\mid x^{2}+px+q=0\\}$，$B=\\{x \\mid x^{2}-x+r=0\\}$，且 $A \\cap B=\\{-1\\}$，$A \\cup B=\\{-1,2\\}$。求实数 $p$、$q$、$r$ 的值。"
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p28_b5",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
