            "1. 若集合 $M=\\{a \\mid a=x+\\sqrt{2}y, x、y \\in \\mathbf{Q}\\}$，则下列结论正确的是（ ）",
            "A. $M \\subseteq \\mathbf{Q}$；",
            "B. $M=\\mathbf{Q}$；",
            "C. $M \\supset \\mathbf{Q}$；",
            "D. $M \\subset \\mathbf{Q}$。"
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
